{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tokyo, New Year\u2019s Eve 1999</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An office tower stands empty under endless rain. Inside \u2014 a silence that seems to be waiting for someone to break it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/7ac7846132fd803fb505ed6a7404db56.poster.avif?t=1761586866\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/7ac7846132fd803fb505ed6a7404db56.webm?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/7ac7846132fd803fb505ed6a7404db56.mp4?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore abandoned floors and forgotten technology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find keys, codes, and notes. Boot up old PCs and piece together fragments of what happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/581beb58f8b0c79fe56b9a3a33f5130b.poster.avif?t=1761586866\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/581beb58f8b0c79fe56b9a3a33f5130b.webm?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/581beb58f8b0c79fe56b9a3a33f5130b.mp4?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No door opens without effort</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend deeper, uncover hidden rooms, and slowly lose your sense of where the past ends and the present begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/c4eaa50961beaecbaa75afaf4e6ef033.poster.avif?t=1761586866\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/c4eaa50961beaecbaa75afaf4e6ef033.webm?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/c4eaa50961beaecbaa75afaf4e6ef033.mp4?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Someone was here before you. Or maybe still is.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is explained directly \u2014 the answers are yours to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/52f2d4dcb723411a03882d019f215d1a.poster.avif?t=1761586866\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/52f2d4dcb723411a03882d019f215d1a.webm?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/52f2d4dcb723411a03882d019f215d1a.mp4?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric psychological horror in a realistic late-90s office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear exploration and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A steadily growing sense of unease and disorientation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalism, focus on atmosphere and subtle tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There are no monsters in this office.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Or are there?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005610?t=1761586866","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/14b5a6399c427abdcf300d34b8fed3cf87e83e74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761586866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/926d31b627e8738fd4ba769431e599b63a2db0c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761586866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/926d31b627e8738fd4ba769431e599b63a2db0c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761586866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tokyo, New Year\u2019s Eve 1999</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An office tower stands empty under endless rain. Inside \u2014 a silence that seems to be waiting for someone to break it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/7ac7846132fd803fb505ed6a7404db56.poster.avif?t=1761586866\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/7ac7846132fd803fb505ed6a7404db56.webm?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/extras/7ac7846132fd803fb505ed6a7404db56.mp4?t=1761586866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore abandoned flo